// blink-x.lmc - blink lamp1: on for half a second, off for half a second, forever
// (extended LMC with the peripherals, NOT part of OCR's LMC)
// SLEEP n waits n milliseconds (n is a number from 0 to 999). The machine only asks for the wait; the simulator does it.
// Choose the "Real time" speed and press Run. (Fast also works but adds a delay to every instruction, so the blinks
// are slower than 500 ms. Instant skips every SLEEP.) Press Pause to stop it.
// Try changing the numbers, or blink lamp2 and lamp3 as well.
loop    LDA #1
        STA lamp1       // lamp on
        SLEEP 500       // wait half a second
        LDA #0
        STA lamp1       // lamp off
        SLEEP 500       // wait again
        BRA loop
